# warehouse-kpi-dashboard currently reads no environment variables -- it
# runs entirely on the local SQLite database (warehouse.db) built from
# synthetic CSV data (data/generate_data.py, build_db.py). Kept as a
# template per the project root interface (nqwrc.dots setup/01, "Standard
# Internal Structure for Every Project Folder") for whenever this needs
# real data-source credentials or connection settings.
